<title>USA: Sioux Falls cattle unevenly steady - USDA.</title>
<headline>Sioux Falls cattle unevenly steady - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>SIOUX FALLS 1997-04-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA said Slaughter steers and heifers were moderately active on a small midweek supply. Both classes traded unevenly steady.</p>
<p>Steers - three part loads choice 3 Blacks 1400-1450 lbs 69.00-70.00. High select and choice 2-3 1200-1400 lbs</p>
<p>67.00-68.50. Select and choice 2-3 1100-1300 lbs 66.00-67.00.</p>
<p>Select 1-2 63.50- 66.00.</p>
<p>Heifers - high select and choice 2-3 1050-1200 lbs 66.00-</p>
<p>67.00. Select and choice 2-3 1000-1125 65.00-66.00. Select 1-2</p>
<p>63.00-65.00.</p>
</text>
